cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite the original publisher of any figure you use."
type: dataset
title: "Data Center Water Benchmarks"
abstract: >
  Publicly disclosed data center water figures, each traced to its publisher: Google's 2025 water
  withdrawal, discharge and consumption by data center location; water usage effectiveness (WUE) for
  AWS (global and cloud regions, 2025), Microsoft (global and regions, FY24 and FY25), Equinix and
  Digital Realty (portfolios, 2025), Meta (2020 to 2024); and the European Commission's 2024 EU average WUE from Energy
  Efficiency Directive reporting; and water per AI prompt and per model trained from Google (Gemini),
  OpenAI (ChatGPT), Mistral AI and Li et al. Values copied exactly as published, with source URL,
  period, scope and retrieval date for every row.
